      "provisions": [],
      "text": "Section 41 of the Trade Marks Act 1995 was amended by the Raising the Bar Act 2012."
    },
    {
      "cases": [],
      "chunk_ref": "TMM/Part22/1/1/1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:ffc4c9db38466721b9790a8180da65093ab04014c0fe969d71cd3e4f00426b3e",
