        "22.1. Registrability under section 41"
      ],
      "internal_refs": [],
      "kind": "body",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "page_ref": "TMM/Part22/1",
      "provisions": [],
      "text": "Applications filed on or after 15 April 2013 are examined under the amended section."
